 1\n          },\n          \"stamina\": {\n            \"current\": 10,\n            \"max\": 10\n          }\n        }\n      }\n    }\n  ],\n  \"summary_update\": {\n    \"chapter_so_far_add\": [\n      \"The system finalized Artie's glitched build and forcefully teleported him from the void into the physical reality of the Tutorial Forest.\"\n    ],\n    \"key_events\": [\n      \"The system finalized Artie's glitched stat allocation.\",\n      \"Fizz failed to bypass the system's Anomaly flag.\",\n      \"Artie and Fizz were forcefully teleported out of the void.\",\n      \"Artie arrived safely in the Tutorial Forest.\"\n    ],\n    \"last_scene\": [\n      \"The system glitch finalized Artie's build against his will, locking his stats at 1 HP and a 100% Critical Hit Rate.\",\n      \"Fizz attempted to override the system lock but was denied.\",\n      \"The teleportation sequence initiated, dragging Artie and Fizz out of the Character Creation Void.\",\n      \"Artie successfully survived the transition and spawned into the Tutorial Forest.\"\n    ],\n    \"must_stay_true\": [\n      \"REMOVE: Artie is dead and his consciousness is floating in the Character Creation Void.\",\n      \"inventory: CHAR_ARTIE -> Leather Wallet (status=stowed, container=pocket_right)\",\n      \"inventory: CHAR_ARTIE -> Employee ID Badge (status=equipped, container=neck_lanyard)\",\n      \"container: pocket_right (owner=CHAR_ARTIE, contents=[ITEM_wallet])\",\n      \"container: neck_lanyard (owner=CHAR_ARTIE, contents=[ITEM_employee_id])\",\n      \"Artie has 1/1 HP, 10/10 Stamina, and a 100% Critical Hit Rate.\",\n      \"Artie's physical avatar has manifested in the Tutorial Forest.\"\n    ]\n  },\n  \"world_updates\": {\n    \"cast_present\": [\n      \"CHAR_ARTIE\",\n      \"CHAR_FIZZ\"\n    ],\n    \"location\": \"LOC_TUTORIAL_FOREST\",\n    \"open_threads\": [\n      \"THREAD_GLITCH\"\n    ]\n  }\n}",
